'''''Star Wars: The Clone Wars'' Seasons 1-5 Collector's Edition''' is a fourteen-disc Blu-ray or nineteen-disc DVD boxed set of all five seasons of the ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]'' television series released on [[October 15]], [[2013]]. It also includes [[The Art of Star Wars: The Clone Wars (booklet)|''The Art of Star Wars: The Clone Wars'']], a 54-page booklet with concept art from all five seasons.

